<section id="bbs025" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>One headline number set very large on the left with its label, and the explanation on the right as a working title and two short paragraphs; a longer figure takes the smaller display size.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="24" vertical-align="center" id="1eLekAS94L"><display size="xl">3×</display><h4>Return on the second van within the quarter</h4></grid-item><grid-item colspan="36" vertical-align="center" id="eF0NHiDkxJ"><h2>The cheapest change in the plan paid back fastest</h2><p>One additional van and a second delivery day for regional accounts cost less than a single new hire and generated retained-order revenue equal to three times its cost by the end of the quarter.</p><p>The same model applies to the southern region once the depot opens.</p></grid-item></grid></section>